  tree's `SwiftExpr.hx` (SwiftExpr was unchanged between 4581308d and the
  coordination tree, consistent with (a)/(c) not yet being applied there).
- **Not against the step-(a)-applied tree and not against the fully-patched
  tree**: the coordination tree already contains the new-side content of two of
  PATCH.diff's four hunks (the `TiqianArray(...)` → `operand + ".toMutableArray()"`
  render simplification in `SwiftArrayBoundary.hx`, and the
