  carries two hunks that are pre-existing *relative to the coordination tree*.
  The litop byte-identity verification is unaffected (it compared generated
  output of the pristine worktree vs the edited worktree, not PATCH.diff).

**Step (x) therefore = PATCH.diff minus its two already-applied hunks** =
exactly the coordination-tree → `litop-wt/wt` delta for the two files,
